,"bottom":"70","left":"20","isLinked":false},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":26,"column":"26","row":"26"}},"elements":[{"id":"ljtblh","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Quelles clauses se négocient le plus, et avec quels appuis ?","align":"center","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto Slab","typography_font_weight":"700","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":32,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.3,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"ljtblt","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Certaines clauses concentrent l’essentiel des pourparlers. Pour chacune, le playbook fournit la position de repli, et l’historique trace ce qui a été concédé.</p>","align":"center","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"ljtbli2","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Le droit français laisse les pourparlers libres : l’article <strong>1112 du Code civil</strong> consacre la liberté d’initiative, de déroulement et de rupture des négociations, sous l’exigence de bonne foi. La contrepartie est connue : une <strong>rupture abusive des négociations</strong> engage la responsabilité de son auteur, et la jurisprudence apprécie la faute au vu de l’avancement des discussions et des engagements laissés entendre. D’où l’intérêt d’une négociation tracée : lettre d’intention, NDA, term sheet, versions successives et concessions horodatées constituent une chronologie objective des échanges. Lumen Juris ne vous dira jamais quoi concéder, l’outil n’est pas un conseil stratégique, mais il garantit que chaque étape des pourparlers laisse une trace exploitable.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"ljtblw","elType":"widget","settings":{"html":"<style>
.lj-table-wrap{overflow-x:auto}
.lj-cmp{width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;background:#fff;
  border:1px solid rgba(27,42,74,.10);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;
  font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;color:#39445A;line-height:1.55;min-width:640px}
.lj-cmp th{background:#1B2A4A;color:#fff;font-family:'Roboto Slab',serif;font-weight:600;
  padding:14px 16px;text-align:left;font-size:14px}
.lj-cmp td{padding:13px 16px;border-top:1px solid rgba(27,42,74,.08);vertical-align:top}
.lj-cmp tr td:first-child{font-weight:600;color:#1C1C1C;white-space:nowrap}
</style>
<div class="lj-table-wrap"><table class="lj-cmp">
<thead><tr><th>Clause négociée</th><th>Enjeu typique</th><th>L’appui dans Lumen Juris</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Responsabilité</td>
<td>Plafonds, exclusions, dommages indirects : le point d’équilibre financier du contrat.</td>
<td>Position de repli du playbook et alerte de la révision si le plafond proposé s’écarte de votre pratique.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Propriété intellectuelle</td>
<td>Titularité des livrables, licences, développements spécifiques.</td>
<td>Clauses de référence de votre bibliothèque, commentaires par clause pour isoler la discussion.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Résiliation</td>
<td>Préavis, cas de résiliation anticipée, conséquences financières.</td>
<td>Comparaison de versions : toute modification du préavis ressort immédiatement.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Pénalités et SLA</td>
<td>Montants, plafonnement, conditions de déclenchement.</td>
<td>Historique des concessions : qui a accepté quoi, quand : la chronologie fait foi en interne.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Prix et indexation</td>
<td>Révision, clause d’échelle mobile, conditions de paiement.</td>
<td>La version signée bascule dans le suivi des échéances pour appliquer l’indexation à la bonne date.</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"html"},{"id":"ljtblb","elType":"widget","settings":{"text":"Essayez la négociation gratuitement","align":"center","link":{"url":"https://www.lumenjuris.com/contactez-nous/","is_external":"","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":""},"typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"700","background_color":"#1B2A4A","button_text_color":"#FFFFFF","border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"8","right":"8","bottom":"8","left":"8","isLinked":true},"text_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"14","right":"28","bottom":"14","left":"28","isLinked":false},"typography_text_decoration":"none"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"button"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"ljtmo9","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","background_background":"classic","border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"15","right":"15","bottom":"15","left":"15","isLinked":true},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"60","right":"40","bottom":"60","left":"40","isLinked":false},"margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"20","bottom":"70","left":"20","isLinked":false},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":35,"column":"35","row":"35"},"flex_align_items_mobile":"center","margin_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"padding_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"20","right":"20","bottom":"20","left":"20","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"ljtmoh","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Un outil de collaboration juridique pour chaque équipe","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto Slab","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":32,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"700","align":"center","title_color":"#000000","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.3,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"ljtmoi","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>La négociation contractuelle B2B mobilise le juridique, le commercial et la direction : chacun intervient dans le même document, a