,"text_color":"#39445A","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljprf1","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","content_width":"full","width":{"unit":"%","size":"33"},"width_mobile":{"unit":"%","size":"100"},"background_background":"classic","background_color":"#FFFFFF","border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"15","right":"15","bottom":"15","left":"15","isLinked":true},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"28","right":"24","bottom":"28","left":"24","isLinked":false},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":12,"column":"12","row":"12"}},"elements":[{"id":"ljpri1","elType":"widget","settings":{"selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-briefcase","library":"fa-solid"},"primary_color":"#1C1C1C","size":{"unit":"px","size":26,"sizes":[]},"align":"left"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"icon"},{"id":"ljprh1","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Juristes & directions juridiques","header_size":"h3","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto Slab","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":18,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"600"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"ljprt1","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Encadrez les négociations menées par les opérationnels : positions de repli imposées par le playbook, validation interne obligatoire avant tout envoi à la partie adverse.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":14,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400","text_color":"#39445A","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljprf2","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","content_width":"full","width":{"unit":"%","size":"33"},"width_mobile":{"unit":"%","size":"100"},"background_background":"classic","background_color":"#FFFFFF","border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"15","right":"15","bottom":"15","left":"15","isLinked":true},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"28","right":"24","bottom":"28","left":"24","isLinked":false},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":12,"column":"12","row":"12"}},"elements":[{"id":"ljpri2","elType":"widget","settings":{"selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-users","library":"fa-solid"},"primary_color":"#1C1C1C","size":{"unit":"px","size":26,"sizes":[]},"align":"left"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"icon"},{"id":"ljprh2","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Commerciaux & achats","header_size":"h3","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto Slab","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":18,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"600"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"ljprt2","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Avancez sans attendre le juridique sur chaque virgule : les clauses négociables et les limites sont connues d’avance, le reste escalade automatiquement.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":14,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400","text_color":"#39445A","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true}],"isInner":true}],"isInner":false},{"id":"ljsecu9","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"20","bottom":"70","left":"20","isLinked":false},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":22,"column":"22","row":"22"}},"elements":[{"id":"ljsecuh","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Des pourparlers confidentiels, hébergés en France","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto Slab","typography_font_weight":"700","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":32,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.3,"sizes":[]},"align":"center"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"ljsecut","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Une négociation expose vos marges, vos limites et vos intentions : sa confidentialité n’est pas négociable. Les échanges menés dans Lumen Juris, commentaires, versions, concessions, sont chiffrés, hébergés en France et traités conformément au RGPD. Vos documents et vos discussions ne servent jamais à entraîner des modèles d’IA, ni les nôtres ni ceux de tiers. Et lorsque la négociation aboutit, le contrat signé et son historique complet rejoignent la contrathèque, où <a href="https://www.lumenjuris.com/suivi-contrats-alertes/">le suivi des échéances</a> prend le relais : préavis, reconductions et révisions de prix issus de la version négociée sont surveillés automatiquement.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"ljsecul","elType":"widget","settings":{"icon_list":[{"_id":"ljsc0","text":"<strong>Hébergement en France</strong> : versions, commentaires et historiques restent sur le territoire.","selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-check-circle","library":"fa-solid"}},{"_id":"ljsc1","text":"<strong>Confidentialité des échanges</strong> : chiffrement, accès limités aux parties à la négociation.","selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-check-circle","library":"fa-solid"}},{"_id":"ljsc2","text":"<strong>Aucun entraînement sur vos documents</strong> : vos pourparlers ne nourrissent aucun modèle d’IA.","selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-check-circle","library":"fa-solid"}}],"space_between":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"icon_color":"#1C1C1C","icon_color_hover":"#1C1C1C","icon_size":{"unit":"px","size":18,"sizes":[]},"text_indent":{"unit":"px","size":12,"sizes":[]},"icon_typography_typography":"custom","icon_typography_font_family":"Roboto","icon_typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"icon_typography_font_weight":"400","icon_typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.6,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"icon-list"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"ljfaq9","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","background_background":"classic","border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"15","right":"15","bottom":"15","left":"15","isLinked":true},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"60","right":"40","bottom":"60","left":"40","isLinked":false},"margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"20","bottom":"70","left":"20","isLinked":false},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":30,"column":"30","row":"30"}},"elements":[{"id":"ljfaqh","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Négociation de contrat : vos questions","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto Slab","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":32,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"700","align":"center","title_color":"#000000","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.3,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"ljfqa0","elType":"widget","widgetType":"nested-accordion","settings":{"items":[{"_id":"ljfq00","item_title":"Comment négocier un contrat efficacement ?"},{"_id":"ljfq01","item_title":"Peut-on rompre des négociations sans risque ?"},{"_id":"ljfq02","item_title":"Comment suivre les versions d’un contrat en cours de négociation ?"},{"_id":"ljfq03","item_title":"Le cocontractant doit-il créer un compte pour négocier ?"},{"_id":"ljfq04","item_title":"Quelles clauses se négocient le plus souvent ?"},{"_id":"ljfq05","item_title":"Les échanges de négociation sont-ils confidentiels ?"},{"_id":"ljfq06","item_title":"Comment fonctionne la validation interne avant envoi ?"},{"_id":"ljfq07","item_title":"La négociation de contrat en ligne est-elle gratuite ?"}],"title_tag":"h3","selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-plus","library":"fa-solid"},"selected_active_icon":{"value":"fas fa-minus","library":"fa-solid"},"title_typography_typography":"custom","title_typography_font_family":"Roboto Slab","title_typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":17,"sizes":[]},"title_typography_font_weight":"600","normal_title_color":"#1C1C1C","accordion_background_background":"classic","accordion_background_color":"#FFFFFF","accordion_border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"15","right":"15","bottom":"15","left":"15","isLinked":true},"accordion_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"18","right":"22","bottom":"18","left":"22","isLinked":false},"space_between_widgets":{"unit":"px","size":12,"sizes":[]},"accordion_item_title_space_between":{"unit":"px","size":12,"sizes":[]},"max_items_expended":"multiple"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqc0","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt0","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Préparez vos positions avant d’ouvrir les pourparlers : clauses non négociables, positions de repli, limites chiffrées. Négociez ensuite clause par clause plutôt que globalement, tracez chaque concession par écrit et validez en interne avant tout envoi. Un outil comme Lumen Juris structure cette méthode : playbook, commentaires par clause, suivi des modifications et historique horodaté des échanges.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc1","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt1","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>La rupture des pourparlers est libre en droit français (article 1112 du Code civil), mais elle doit rester de bonne foi : une rupture brutale de négociations avancées, après avoir laissé croire à la conclusion du contrat, peut engager la responsabilité de son auteur. La chronologie des échanges est alors déterminante, d’où l’intérêt de négociations tracées et horodatées. Pour les situations à enjeu, consultez un professionnel.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc2","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt2","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Travaillez sur un document unique plutôt que sur des pièces jointes qui se croisent, et utilisez un comparateur de versions : chaque écart entre deux versions, ajout, suppression, clause concernée, auteur, date, doit être visible d’un coup d’œil. Dans Lumen Juris, le redlining est automatique et l’historique complet reste attaché au contrat jusqu’à la contrathèque.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc3","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt3","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Non. Votre cocontractant reçoit un lien sécurisé et participe à la négociation depuis son navigateur : lecture du contrat, commentaires, propositions de modification. Aucune création de compte ni installation n’est requise de son côté. Ses amendements entrent dans le même circuit de suivi des modifications et de validation interne que les vôtres.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc4","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt4","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Dans les contrats d’affaires, l’essentiel des pourparlers porte sur la responsabilité (plafonds et exclusions), la propriété intellectuelle, la résiliation et ses préavis, les pénalités et niveaux de service, et le prix avec ses mécanismes d’indexation. Ce sont aussi les clauses pour lesquelles disposer de positions de repli écrites, issues d’un playbook contractuel, fait gagner le plus de temps.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc5","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt5","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Oui. Dans Lumen Juris, les versions, commentaires et concessions sont chiffrés, hébergés en France et accessibles aux seules parties à la négociation. Les documents ne servent jamais à entraîner des modèles d’IA. Pour la confidentialité juridique des pourparlers eux-mêmes, un NDA reste la bonne pratique, vous pouvez le générer et le faire signer dans la même plateforme.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc6","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt6","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Avant qu’une version amendée ne parte chez la partie adverse, elle passe par votre circuit d’approbation : le responsable désigné, juridique, direction, relit les modifications, les accepte ou les refuse. Rien ne sort sans validation, et l’historique conserve qui a approuvé quoi. Les opérationnels avancent, le juridique garde le contrôle.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc7","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt7","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Vous pouvez essayer gratuitement la négociation dans Lumen Juris : importez ou générez un contrat, invitez votre cocontractant par lien sécurisé et testez les commentaires par clause, le suivi des modifications et la comparaison de versions sur un cas réel. L’essai est sans engagement, au sein de la plateforme complète, de la génération à la signature.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true}]}],"isInner":false},{"id":"ljcta9","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","flex_align_items":"center","background_background":"gradient","background_color":"#EAF1F9","background_color_b":"#A4BFDF","background_gradient_angle":{"unit":"deg","size":135,"sizes":[]},"min_height":{"unit":"px","size":360,"sizes":[]},"flex_justify_content":"center","background_overlay_background":"classic","background_overlay_image":{"url":"","id":"","size":"","alt":"","source":"library"},"margin":{"unit":"px","top":"-17","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"ljctah","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Menez votre prochaine négociation de contrat en ligne","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto Slab","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":32,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"800","title_color":"#1C1C1C","typography_text_transform":"uppercase","text_stroke_text_stroke_type":"yes","align_mobile":"center"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"ljctat","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Essayez gratuitement la négociation de contrat dans Lumen Juris : commentaires par clause, versions comparées, concessions tracées, et la version finale qui part en signature sans ressaisie. Le rapport de force reste votre affaire ; la traçabilité devient la nôtre.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400","text_color":"#000000","align":"center","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"41c801f","elType":"widget","settings":{"text":"Demandez une démo","link":{"url":"https://www.lumenjuris.com/contactez-nous/","is_external":"","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":""},"typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"700","typography_font_style":"normal","typography_text_decoration":"none","background_color":"#FFFFFF","button_box_shadow_box_shadow_type":"yes","button_box_shadow_box_shadow":{"horizontal":0,"vertical":0,"blur":10,"spread":0,"color":"rgba(230.81748962402344, 229.81393532131028, 229.81393532131028, 0.5)"},"border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"6","right":"6","bottom":"6","left":"6","isLinked":true}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"button"}],"isInner":false}]
